cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the Operational Taxalist, please cite the preferred-citation below."
type: software

title: "Data to: Standardizing freshwater macroinvertebrate taxonomy: a Lithuanian operational taxalist for ecological quality assessments and biodiversity research"

abstract: >-
  An R pipeline and accompanying Operational Taxalist (OTL) for
  standardising freshwater macroinvertebrate taxonomy in Lithuania. The
  OTL harmonises taxon names across literature and national monitoring
  sources, and the pipeline recalculates the multimetric Lithuanian
  River Macroinvertebrate Index (LRMI) under the EU Water Framework
  Directive, comparing the result against published ecological quality
  ratios.

# Software authorship (this repository's code) is Nathan Baker alone.
# Manuscript authorship differs and is listed separately below under
# preferred-citation, in manuscript order.
